      <string>&lt;html&gt;&lt;head/&gt;&lt;body&gt;&lt;p&gt;It appears that you are attempting an action that violates our security policies.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Your activity has been detected and logged. To protect the integrity of our educational content, actions such as screen &lt;br/&gt;recording, screen sharing, or any other form of unauthorized content capture are strictly prohibited.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Please understand that any such activities in the may lead to an FIR and can permanently affect your career.&lt;br/&gt;Please adhere to the following guidelines: &lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; -qt-list-indent: 1;&quot;&gt;&lt;li style=&quot; margin-top:12px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;Do not attempt to record or share the screen during playback of educational content &lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;Ensure that your device is secure and free from any software that could interfere with our security measures &lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;Failure to comply with these guidelines may result in restricted access or termination of your account.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;</string>
